Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:36:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 096/128] dt-bindings: display: mediatek: dsi: Add MT6858

The MT6858 DSI has the MT8186/MT8188 register layout (command queue at
0xd00, VM command at 0x200, shadow at 0xc00) but its own HS buffer and
QoS setup in the vendor driver, so it gets its own compatible.
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/display/mediatek/mediatek,dsi.yaml       | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/mediatek/mediatek,dsi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/mediatek/mediatek,dsi.yaml
index 27ffbccc2..2e6ceaba2 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/mediatek/mediatek,dsi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/mediatek/mediatek,dsi.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - enum:
           - mediatek,mt2701-dsi
+          - mediatek,mt6858-dsi
           - mediatek,mt7623-dsi
           - mediatek,mt8167-dsi
           - mediatek,mt8173-dsi
